usage: compose_pack_view.py [-h] --pack PACK [--candidate-id CANDIDATE_ID]
                            [--verify-view VERIFY_VIEW] [--output OUTPUT]

Create a lossless, on-demand composition view of an immutable v6 pack. Only
known optional candidate inventories are deferred. Every other field,
including unknown future requirements, remains visible. This is a reading aid;
the original pack remains the sole input to composition and runtime audits.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --pack PACK
  --candidate-id CANDIDATE_ID
  --verify-view VERIFY_VIEW
  --output OUTPUT
